        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF146 WeakMap/WeakSet use non-registered symbols as keys/values]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28498</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28498"/>
        <updated>2025-11-21T04:01:13.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF146 adds support for using non-registered symbols as keys for WeakMap and values for WeakSet in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The issue only talks about WeakMap, but I ran a test for WeakSet and that behaves the same way:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="const ws = new WeakSet();
const sym = Symbol('foo');
ws.add(sym); "><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">ws</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-k">new</span> <span class="pl-v">WeakSet</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
<span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">sym</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-v">Symbol</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s">'foo'</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
<span class="pl-s1">ws</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">add</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">sym</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span> </pre></div>
<p dir="auto">This updates the subfeature.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3607691670" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41868/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868">mdn/content#41868</a></p>]]></content>
